  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently it seems like custom animations in VRC_Stations do not work without enabling \"Seated\", and therefore IK.\n\nIn the MMD Avatars Dance Stage world, this has the undesirable effect of rooting your feet to the floor and rotating your head with your viewpoint, which completely breaks the dance animations. The current workaround used in the world is to use an emote (I think the emotes are assigned the same animation clip as the idle?) while in the VRC_Station, which switches off IK for a while but needs to be regularly reapplied mid-dance.\n\nImproved VRC_Stations that allow worlds like the MMD Avatars Dance Stage world to work smoothly would be appreciated.",
